[[63,7,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584862\">5050B34</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585214\">7055A18</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the protective cover (1b).</p><p>2. Disconnect the electrical connections from the CNG control unit.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Methane injection control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M19A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>2</p></td><td><p>Methane injection control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M19B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>3. Undo the fixing bolts (3a) and remove the CNG control unit (3b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2065950.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,16384,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the CNG control unit.</p><p>Connect the electrical connections and\ntighten the bolts fixing it to the bracket.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Methane injection control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M19A</span></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Methane injection control unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><span class=\"dead-link\">M19B</span></p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the protective cover on the CNG control\nunit and tighten the fixing bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585214\">7055A18</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584862\">5050B34</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p>"]]